when and the truth is

00:00:41.679 --> 00:00:43.639
it's not it's just more stuff, right?

00:00:43.679 --> 00:00:45.800
It's this hedonistic treadmill where you

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:47.880
just keep running and you keep grabbing and

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.479
you keep going for the next ring.

00:00:49.519 --> 00:00:51.560
And what happens is you'll see these people

