00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.080
and ask ourselves.

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:31.840
First of all, because when we're 17,

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:33.280
somebody asks us to define who we should

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:34.800
be and we don't have the capacity to

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.960
do it. And then we also don't give

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.759
ourselves the grace to change.

00:03:38.919 --> 00:03:40.480
We don't give ourselves the grace to say,

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.480
you know, this isn't for me.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:44.080
This isn't where I want to be.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.160
And so we we do get trapped in

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.360
this idea, this sort of external

00:03:48.919 --> 00:03:50.460
view of what should be.

